      "title": "Adjunct Faculty – Acting for the Camera",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty – Acting for the Camera. Webster University’s Sargent Conservatory of Theatre Arts invites applications for an adjunct faculty member specializing in Acting for the Camera . Essential Duties - Teach Acting for the Camera – a unit within CONS 4010 and MUTH 4010 - Attend semester auditions to observe performance majors - Lead weekly classes - Mentor students - Collaborate with performance faculty Bachelor's degree and/or extensive experience in the field"
